# "When Lutri enters, if you cast it": a Lutri returned by Corpse Dance was not cast (CR 603.4, 603.6a). Turn 1: Bot1 flashes Lutri in
# (no spell to copy, so the trigger has no target) and Bot2 Bolts it on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot2 and, with it on
# the stack - a legal target for the trigger - responds with Corpse Dance, which returns Lutri from the graveyard. Lutri enters uncast: nothing
# is copied, and Bot2 takes the one Bolt's 3.

